Run `ng update @angular/core@20` to apply the automated `inject-flags` migration, or manually convert flag arguments.

**Before/after:**
```typescript
// Before
import { inject, InjectFlags, ElementRef } from '@angular/core';
element = inject(ElementRef, InjectFlags.Optional | InjectFlags.Host | InjectFlags.SkipSelf);

// After
import { inject, ElementRef } from '@angular/core';
element = inject(ElementRef, { optional: true, host: true, skipSelf: true });
```
`InjectFlags.Host` → `{ host: true }`, `Optional` → `{ optional: true }`, `Self` → `{ self: true }`, `SkipSelf` → `{ skipSelf: true }`, `Default` → `{}`.

