Re-check every effect registered with a root injector, since execution order is now creation order rather than dirty-notification order. **Before/after:**
```typescript
// Creation order: A, B
effect(() => log.push(`A: ${sourceA()}`), {injector: appRef.injector});
effect(() => log.push(`B: ${sourceB()}`), {injector: appRef.injector});
// Dirty order: B, A => effects still run in A, B creation order
await appRef.whenStable();
expect(log).toEqual(['A: 2', 'B: 1']);
```

